{"parse": {"title": "重塑之手", "pageid": 6545, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"preamble\">\n    <div class=\"preamble-background\"></div>\n    <div class=\"preamble-content\"><p>他们为复兴而来，亦是为复仇而来。</p><p>重塑万事万物，世界予其高贵的血液与他们当有的权柄。</p><p>那属于秘法与传承者们的旗帜，终将悬于世间最高的灯塔之上。</p></div>\n</div>\n<p><b>重塑之手<span style=\"color:#bc9567; font-size:smaller;\">（Manus Vindictae）</span></b>是一个神秘学恐怖组织。为游戏的主要反派组织，也是<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E6%B4%9B%E5%A4%AB%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E4%BC%9A\" title=\"圣洛夫基金会\">圣洛夫基金会</a>的主要斗争目标。\n</p><p>该组织热衷于引发争端以人为引发“<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%B4%E9%9B%A8\" title=\"暴雨\">暴雨</a>”，力求回到“秩序正确的时代”，即神秘学家不受歧视的时代。其组织成员多着深蓝色、黑色色系的衣着，部分成员佩戴黑色手性面具。\n</p><p>组织内部成员分为“追随者”、“门徒”、“信徒”、“使徒”四类。<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\">&#91;1&#93;</a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E7.BB.84.E7.BB.87.E6.88.90.E5.91.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"组织成员\">组织成员</span></h2>\n<p>下面列出了剧情中出现的主要组织成员与前成员。<span style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; padding: 2px;\">画框</span>代表角色已死亡或已被回溯，不处于主线的时间线上；<s>划线</s>代表角色已不任该职。\n</p>\n<ul><li>领袖<span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/1.x#阿尔卡纳\" title=\"其他角色一览/1.x#阿尔卡纳\"><img alt=\"Bgequip1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/100px-Bgequip1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/150px-Bgequip1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/200px-Bgequip1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/1.x#阿尔卡纳\" title=\"阿尔卡纳\"><img alt=\"阿尔卡纳\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-501901.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-501901.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-501901.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E5%8D%A1%E7%BA%B3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"阿尔卡纳（页面不存在）\">阿尔卡纳</a>：于「<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%A4%E7%8B%AC%E4%B9%8B%E6%AD%8C\" title=\"孤独之歌\">孤独之歌</a>」中被“消灭”，又于「<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD\" title=\"复乐园\">复乐园</a>」中复活。</li>\n<li>骨干成员：\n<ul><li><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/1.x#勿忘我\" title=\"其他角色一览/1.x#勿忘我\"><img alt=\"Bgequip1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/100px-Bgequip1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/150px-Bgequip1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/200px-Bgequip1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/1.x#勿忘我\" title=\"勿忘我\"><img alt=\"勿忘我\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/1.x#勿忘我\" title=\"其他角色一览/1.x\">勿忘我</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/1.x#苏菲亚\" title=\"其他角色一览/1.x#苏菲亚\"><img alt=\"Bgequip1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/100px-Bgequip1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/150px-Bgequip1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/200px-Bgequip1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/1.x#苏菲亚\" title=\"苏菲亚\"><img alt=\"苏菲亚\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/1.x#苏菲亚\" title=\"其他角色一览/1.x\">苏菲亚</a></span></span>：于「<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%A4%E7%8B%AC%E4%B9%8B%E6%AD%8C\" title=\"孤独之歌\">孤独之歌</a>」中阿派朗学派分崩离析后加入。</li></ul></li>\n<li>成员：\n<ul><li><s><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A7%B2%E5%AF%84%E7%94%9F\" title=\"槲寄生\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A7%B2%E5%AF%84%E7%94%9F\" title=\"槲寄生\"><img alt=\"槲寄生\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A7%B2%E5%AF%84%E7%94%9F\" title=\"槲寄生\">槲寄生</a></s>：「<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%9C%E8%89%B2%E6%B8%A9%E6%9F%94\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"夜色温柔\">夜色温柔</a>」中叛变，加入司辰小队。</li>\n<li><s><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E7%B4%A2%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"伊索尔德\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E7%B4%A2%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"伊索尔德\"><img alt=\"伊索尔德\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-308101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-308101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E7%B4%A2%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"伊索尔德\">伊索尔德</a></s></li>\n<li><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%AF%E5%A5%88%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"斯奈德\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%AF%E5%A5%88%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"斯奈德\"><img alt=\"斯奈德\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span><span style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; padding: 2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%AF%E5%A5%88%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"斯奈德\">斯奈德</a></span>：「<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%9C%E8%89%B2%E6%B8%A9%E6%9F%94\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"夜色温柔\">夜色温柔</a>」中被暴雨回溯。</li>\n<li><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/1.x#海因里希\" title=\"其他角色一览/1.x#海因里希\"><img alt=\"Bgequip1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/100px-Bgequip1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/150px-Bgequip1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/200px-Bgequip1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/1.x#海因里希\" title=\"海因里希\"><img alt=\"海因里希\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-512301.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-512301.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-512301.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span><span style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; padding: 2px;\">海因里希</span></li>\n<li><s><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF\" title=\"挖掘艺术\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF\" title=\"挖掘艺术\"><img alt=\"挖掘艺术\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF\" title=\"挖掘艺术\">挖掘艺术</a></s></li>\n<li><s><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF%E5%A8%9C%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"天使娜娜\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF%E5%A8%9C%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"天使娜娜\"><img alt=\"天使娜娜\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF%E5%A8%9C%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"天使娜娜\">天使娜娜</a></s>：又名“金伯利女郎”，于「<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E9%A9%B0%EF%BC%81%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%9F%8E\" title=\"飞驰！明日之城\">飞驰！明日之城</a>」中被重塑之手方召唤出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94\" title=\"伊戈尔\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94\" title=\"伊戈尔\"><img alt=\"伊戈尔\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94\" title=\"伊戈尔\">伊戈尔</a></span></span>：原属芝诺阵营，于「<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BF%A7%E9%83%81%E7%9A%84%E7%83%AD%E5%B8%A6\" title=\"忧郁的热带\">忧郁的热带</a>」叛变加入重塑之手。在<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BF%9C%E5%BE%81%E8%AE%B0\" title=\"远征记\">远征记</a>中被证明脱离重塑之手。</li>\n<li><s><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/2.x#淑女格蕾丝\" title=\"其他角色一览/2.x#淑女格蕾丝\"><img alt=\"Bgequip1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/100px-Bgequip1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/150px-Bgequip1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Bgequip1.png/200px-Bgequip1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%80%E8%A7%88/2.x#淑女格蕾丝\" title=\"淑女格蕾丝\"><img alt=\"淑女格蕾丝\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-624901.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-624901.png\" 